   util/tactics.v patch makes Prosa's `done` call itself under Rocq 9.3).
2. `fmfs_finds_fixpoint` uses the util/list.v lemma `has_all_nilp`; the validation chain
   binds util/list.v by its accepted statement-only semantic source, so that lemma's
   two-line proof is inlined at its only use. No statement or definition changes.
